red place (Neidermeyer 25, Early 28, Cott 29, Brandao 30, ... Levasseur 41) carries that same +1. Every slash is on the sheet and none is an X or exhibition mark, no team-place column exists, and the final count agrees only with the extra 1 (64-24 struck = 40 vs written 41), so one skipped number (23) in the scorer's hand renumbering is the only explanation; printed scores kept, file stays a mismatch for Portland, South Portland and MGA, whose totals are each 1 per scorer after Fergeson higher than the finish order."
